    "title": "Veterans Affairs Police Accessed Local Flock License Plate Reader Database - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ANDRÉ COLEMAN, MANAGING EDITOR ,\n20 hours ago Although Pasadena Now published on Monday that no federal agency had accessed the Pasadena Police Department’s automatic license plate reader database, it turns out that was not correct. The U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs Police twice accessed the database during a search of state databases. Police reported the incident... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
